msgid ""
"**Description**: Get metadata about a specific GeneNetwork dataset "
"including its full name, data type, data scale, tissue, and public access"
" status. Returns information about expression profiling datasets from "
"genetic crosses (BXD, LXS, etc.) covering various tissues and platforms. "
"Use GeneNetwork\\_list\\_datasets to find available dataset names first."
msgstr ""

